config BR2_PACKAGE_PD_IMAGE_SLOTS
	bool "pd-image-slots"
	help
	  Copies one slot's boot and root partitions out of a whole disk
	  image streamed on stdin, without seeking. The device package's
	  A/B updater (/usr/lib/pd-device/update) uses it to install the
	  same .img.xz that is flashed over USB into the inactive slot.

	  Source: src/pd-image-slots.c in this package.
